fortibackup (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Optional VDOM scope per device (vdom = "tenant-x").
  * Post-fetch payload validation: reject HTML / login walls / truncated
    bodies that would otherwise be persisted as fake backups.
  * S3 / S3-compatible (MinIO, Wasabi, B2) mirror destination, configured
    under [storage.s3]. Filesystem remains the authoritative store.
  * Shell completions (bash/zsh/fish) and man page packaged with the .deb.

 -- Luis Herrera <luis.herrera@rnpn.gob.sv>  Sat, 17 May 2026 00:30:00 +0000

fortibackup (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * REST API and SSH transports for FortiGate.
  * Per-device cron scheduling, SHA-256 deduplication, retention.
  * Email + webhook notifications, optional gzip compression.
  * Optional Prometheus /metrics exporter.
  * systemd unit with filesystem hardening.

 -- Luis Herrera <luis.herrera@rnpn.gob.sv>  Sat, 16 May 2026 23:00:00 +0000
